Output tapes/crush-pmoves-bringup.gif
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# crush-pmoves one-shot bringup"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "crush-pmoves"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# Crush boots with PMOVES context: AGENT_TRAIL, signatures, BOOTSTRAP"
Sleep 2s

Type "# LSP servers auto-detected: gopls, pyright, typescript-language-server"
Sleep 1s

Type "# MCP servers: pmoves-mini, pmoves-nats-fleet, pmoves-supabase, pmoves-cipher"
Sleep 2s

Type "# Ready. The open diamond ◇ has its facets."
Sleep 1s
